msgid "Acre Inch"
msgstr "英亩英寸"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:591
msgid "Acres and hectares measure land area. Acre-feet measure volume of water covering an acre one foot deep—an irrigation and reservoir unit. The shared word acre tricks newcomers into treating them as interchangeable."
msgstr "英亩和公顷测量土地面积。英亩英尺测量一英亩一英尺深的水量——灌溉和水库单位。共享词“acre”会欺骗新手，让他们将它们视为可互换的。"

#: src/components/ads/ad-slot.tsx:35
msgid "Advertisement"
msgstr "广告"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:1380
msgid "Air-fryers and toaster ovens have different thermal mass. Treat their charts as separate; still convert units carefully when a recipe only lists one scale."
msgstr "空气炸锅和烤箱具有不同的热质量。将他们的图表视为单独的；当食谱只列出一种比例时，仍然要小心地转换单位。"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:375
msgid "Alcohol and extracts in teaspoons look trivial until you scale cocktails or flavourings for a crowd. Convert to millilitres, scale, then portion with a jug or syringe for consistency."
msgstr "茶匙中的酒精和提取物看起来微不足道，直到您为人群调制鸡尾酒或调味品。转换为毫升，称量，然后用壶或注射器分装以确保一致性。"

#: src/routes/$lang/category.$quantity.tsx:178
msgid "All {tQuantity} units"
msgstr "所有 {tQuantity} 单位"

