#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:463
msgid "Habits for error-free prefix conversion"
msgstr "无错误前缀转换的习惯"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:1076
msgid "Hard conversion uses exact factors and preserves the original intent as closely as rounding allows. Soft conversion chooses a convenient near value in the other unit system, possibly adjusting tolerances, for manufacturability in local tooling."
msgstr "硬转换使用精确的因子并在舍入允许的情况下尽可能保留原始意图。软转换在其他单位系统中选择一个方便的接近值，可能会调整公差，以实现本地工具的可制造性。"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:1028
msgid "Hard conversion uses exact factors and then rounds according to a stated rule that preserves the intent of the tolerance. Soft conversion picks a convenient nearby nominal in the other system. Both are valid strategies—but they are different strategies. Write which one you used in the revision block."
msgstr "硬转换使用精确的因子，然后根据保留容差意图的规定规则进行舍入。软转换在其他系统中选择一个方便的附近标称值。两者都是有效的策略——但它们是不同的策略。在修订块中写下您使用的是哪一个。"

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:236
msgid "Hardware acceleration and GPU pipelines often force floats. In those cases, keep authoritative conversion in decimal on the CPU or server, and treat GPU floats as a display or intermediate approximation."
msgstr "硬件加速和 GPU 管道通常会强制浮动。在这些情况下，请在 CPU 或服务器上保留十进制的权威转换，并将 GPU 浮点视为显示或中间近似值。"

